{"seq":2,"slug":"metabolic-networks-fba","title":"代谢网络与通量分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/systems-biology/networks-modeling/metabolic-networks-fba","wordCount":1687,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"代谢网络与通量分析\">代谢网络与通量分析</h1><p>如果说<a href=\"gene-regulatory-networks\">基因调控网络</a>管的是「细胞决定做什么」，那代谢网络管的就是「细胞怎么把原料变成能量和物质」。它由成千上万个酶催化的化学反应首尾相接构成——糖进来，ATP、氨基酸、脂质出去。代谢网络有一个让它格外适合建模的特性：它受化学计量守恒的硬约束，这让我们即使不知道每个酶的精确动力学参数，也能用一种优雅的方法预测细胞的代谢流。本篇讲清这套方法——通量平衡分析（FBA），它是系统生物学里最成功、最实用的建模框架之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>代谢网络可表示为一个化学计量矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>：行是代谢物，列是反应，元素 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是代谢物 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 在反应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 中的化学计量系数（消耗为负、生成为正）。每个反应有一个通量（flux）<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，表示单位时间该反应进行的速率。整个网络的状态就是通量向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>FBA 的核心洞见是稳态假设：在稳定生长时，每个内部代谢物的浓度不变（生成等于消耗），即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S \\vec{v} = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>。这一个矩阵方程就把所有可能的通量分布约束到一个高维「解空间」里——无需知道任何酶动力学参数。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[基因组注释] --&gt; B[代谢网络重构&lt;br/&gt;反应+基因关联]&#10;    B --&gt; C[化学计量矩阵 S]&#10;    C --&gt; D[稳态约束&lt;br/&gt;Sv=0]&#10;    E[反应边界&lt;br/&gt;上下界 lb/ub] --&gt; F[可行解空间]&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    G[目标函数&lt;br/&gt;如最大化生长] --&gt; H[线性规划求解]&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[最优通量分布 v]&#10;    I --&gt; J[预测生长率/产物]\">flowchart TD\n    A[基因组注释] --&gt; B[代谢网络重构&lt;br/&gt;反应+基因关联]\n    B --&gt; C[化学计量矩阵 S]\n    C --&gt; D[稳态约束&lt;br/&gt;Sv=0]\n    E[反应边界&lt;br/&gt;上下界 lb/ub] --&gt; F[可行解空间]\n    D --&gt; F\n    G[目标函数&lt;br/&gt;如最大化生长] --&gt; H[线性规划求解]\n    F --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[最优通量分布 v]\n    I --&gt; J[预测生长率/产物]</pre><p>FBA 与需要动力学参数的方法形成鲜明对比，理解这一权衡是选对工具的关键：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>需要参数</th>\n<th>给出</th>\n<th>适用规模</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>FBA</td>\n<td>仅化学计量</td>\n<td>稳态通量分布</td>\n<td>全基因组</td>\n<td>无浓度、无瞬态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动力学 ODE</td>\n<td>全部速率常数</td>\n<td>浓度时程</td>\n<td>小通路</td>\n<td>参数难获取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>13C 通量分析</td>\n<td>同位素数据</td>\n<td>实测通量</td>\n<td>中心代谢</td>\n<td>实验昂贵</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"通量平衡分析的数学\">通量平衡分析的数学</h2><p>FBA 把代谢预测变成一个线性规划（LP）问题，这是它能扩展到全基因组的关键。问题的三要素是：稳态约束 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S\\vec{v}=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>、每个反应的通量边界 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_j^{min} \\le v_j \\le v_j^{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2194em;vertical-align:-0.3948em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8247em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3948em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9221em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0592em;vertical-align:-0.3948em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3948em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（编码反应的可逆性和营养摄取限制）、以及一个要优化的目标函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z = \\vec{c}^\\top \\vec{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1799em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>最常用的目标是「最大化生物量产出」——把构成细胞的各种前体（氨基酸、核苷酸、脂质）按比例打包成一个虚拟的「生物量反应」，最大化它的通量就等价于最大化生长速率。求解这个 LP 得到一组使生长最快的通量分布。这背后有个生物学假设：细菌等生物经长期演化，其代谢被自然选择调到接近「生长最优」——这一假设在快速生长的微生物里惊人地准确。值得注意的是，FBA 的解通常不唯一（解空间是个多面体上的一个面），通量变异分析（FVA）可以算出每个反应通量在保持最优时的可变范围，告诉你哪些反应是「刚性」的、哪些是「柔性」的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"基因组规模代谢模型-gem\">基因组规模代谢模型（GEM）</h2><p>FBA 的威力在于它能直接驱动「基因组规模代谢模型」（GEM）——把一个物种基因组里所有已注释的代谢酶对应的反应全部纳入一张网络。这是从基因组到表型的一条最完整、最可计算的桥梁，也是<a href=\"../methods/constraint-genome-scale\">全基因组约束模型</a>那一篇要深入的主题，本篇先讲它与代谢的关系。</p>\n<p>GEM 的构建是个浩大工程：从基因组注释出酶 → 对应到反应 → 补全缺口 → 用实验数据反复校验。大肠杆菌的 GEM（如 iML1515）和人类的 Recon 系列（Recon2、Recon3D）是被反复打磨的「黄金标准」模型。人类 GEM 因为规模巨大、组织特异性强，常需要简化——如 redHUMAN 工作流对 Recon2/Recon3D 做热力学整理并推导出白血病特异的简化模型（<a href=\"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-020-16549-2\">Nature Communications, 2020</a>）。GEM 加上组织特异的<a href=\"../foundations/omics-data\">组学数据</a>（哪些酶在该细胞里表达），就能定制出器官特异、甚至个体特异的代谢模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工具与-2026-年的实践\">工具与 2026 年的实践</h2><p>代谢建模的事实标准工具是 COBRA（基于约束的重构与分析）生态：MATLAB 的 COBRA Toolbox 和 Python 的 COBRApy。COBRApy 让你用几行代码加载 SBML 格式的 GEM、设定营养条件、跑 FBA/FVA、做基因敲除模拟。它几乎是每个代谢系统生物学项目的起点。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import cobra&#10;model = cobra.io.read_sbml_model(&quot;iML1515.xml&quot;)&#10;solution = model.optimize()        # 最大化生物量&#10;print(solution.objective_value)    # 预测生长率\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cobra</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cobra.io.read_sbml_model(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"iML1515.xml\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">solution </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model.optimize()        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 最大化生物量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(solution.objective_value)    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 预测生长率</span></span></code></pre></div><p>经典 FBA 假设稳态，但真实发酵过程营养会耗尽、产物会积累，于是有动态 FBA（dFBA）——把时间切成小段，每段内跑一次 FBA 并更新培养基浓度。2025 年有工作把 COBRApy 的 dFBA 协议简单扩展到群落（多物种）代谢层面，模拟微生物之间的代谢交换（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2509.08263\">arXiv, 2025</a>）。这把代谢建模从单细胞推向了肠道菌群、土壤微生物组这类生态系统尺度，是 2026 年的活跃前沿。</p>\n<h2 id=\"应用-代谢工程与疾病\">应用：代谢工程与疾病</h2><p>FBA 不是纸上谈兵，它直接指导工业生产和疾病研究。在代谢工程里，目标是让微生物多产某种化学品（如生物燃料、药物前体）。FBA 能预测「敲除哪些基因、过表达哪些酶」能把通量从生长重新导向目标产物——OptKnock 等算法系统地搜索这种敲除组合，把试错从「实验室几年」压缩到「计算机几小时」。</p>\n<p>在疾病研究里，癌细胞有独特的代谢（如 Warburg 效应——即便有氧也偏好糖酵解），用癌症特异 GEM 可以预测哪些代谢酶是肿瘤的「软肋」：敲除它对正常细胞影响小、却能饿死癌细胞。这正是利用了<a href=\"../foundations/systems-paradigm\">系统生物学范式</a>里讲的「鲁棒性的脆弱点转移」。代谢模型还能与<a href=\"signaling-dynamics\">信号网络与动力学</a>、调控网络整合，构成更完整的细胞模型，最终汇入<a href=\"../applications/multi-omics-integration\">多组学整合</a>的大图景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>代谢网络由酶催化反应构成，用化学计量矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 表示；稳态假设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S\\vec{v}=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 是其可建模性的关键。</li>\n<li>FBA 把代谢预测变成线性规划：稳态约束 + 通量边界 + 目标函数（常为最大化生物量），无需酶动力学参数。</li>\n<li>基因组规模代谢模型（GEM，如 iML1515、Recon3D）是从基因组到表型最完整的可计算桥梁，详见<a href=\"../methods/constraint-genome-scale\">全基因组约束模型</a>。</li>\n<li>COBRApy 是事实标准工具；动态 FBA 与群落代谢建模是 2026 年把方法推向生态尺度的前沿。</li>\n<li>应用横跨代谢工程（OptKnock 优化产物）与疾病（找癌细胞代谢软肋），并可与<a href=\"signaling-dynamics\">信号</a>、调控网络整合。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"代谢网络与通量分析","id":"代谢网络与通量分析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"通量平衡分析的数学","id":"通量平衡分析的数学"},{"level":2,"text":"基因组规模代谢模型（GEM）","id":"基因组规模代谢模型-gem"},{"level":2,"text":"工具与 2026 年的实践","id":"工具与-2026-年的实践"},{"level":2,"text":"应用：代谢工程与疾病","id":"应用-代谢工程与疾病"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"基因调控网络","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/systems-biology/networks-modeling/gene-regulatory-networks"},"next":{"title":"信号网络与动力学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/systems-biology/networks-modeling/signaling-dynamics"}}